  Usage:
    {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-left' %}
    {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-left', style: 'solid' %}
    {% render 'icon', name: 'magnifying-glass', style: 'light', class: 'header-search__icon open' %}
    {% render 'icon', name: 'cc-visa', style: 'brands', title: 'Visa' %}

  Params:
    name  - icon name without the "fa-" prefix (required)
    style - solid | regular | light | brands  (default: regular)
    class - extra CSS classes to add alongside the base .icon class
    title - accessible label; when given the icon is exposed to AT, otherwise hidden
{%- endcomment -%}
